/* ----------------------------------------------------------------- */
/* Program  : DKICUSC                                                */
/* Desc     : Bank DKI - Entry point aplikasi data nasabah           */
/*            Pasang library AMNA1 lalu panggil DKICUSR.             */
/* Usage    : CALL AMNA1/DKICUSC                                     */
